# dpkg conffiles for the universal-db-mcp package.
#
# NOTE: dpkg-deb does NOT strip comments from DEBIAN/conffiles — only absolute
# pathnames may remain — so build_deb.sh strips comment/blank lines while
# staging this template (and fails the build if nothing is left).
#
# The default MCP server config is a dpkg conffile (plan Phase 4):
#   - dpkg places it at /etc/universal-db-mcp/config.yaml at unpack time;
#   - admin edits are preserved on upgrade (dpkg prompts only on local
#     modification vs. a changed shipped default);
#   - it is kept on `remove` and deleted on `purge` (standard conffile
#     semantics; postrm additionally removes it on purge).
# postinst keeps its only-if-absent seeding as a fallback for a config an
# admin deleted before an upgrade; it never overwrites an existing file.
/etc/universal-db-mcp/config.yaml
